  "body": "Also rewrites the algorithm in more modern style, which clears up some\nconfusion around \"resources\" and load events and such.\n\nFixes #3876.\n\n@qdot, take a look at the new algorithm? Hopefully you can write tests showing that the load event does not get fired in this case; then we can merge this.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3900/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 20, 2018, 11:42 AM GMT (441b3e7)\">/iframe-embed-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3900/39dbb3e...441b3e7/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 20, 2018, 11:42 AM GMT (441b3e7)\">diff</a> )",
